#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "A CV downloaded as a Europass file, for a portal or a service that reads the European CV format: its entries and the details it prints, in its language. What Europass has no place for is said beside the download. Switched off, the download is not offered and its address answers as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "In CV telechargià sco datoteca Europass, per ina plattafurma u in servetsch che legia il format europeic da CV: ses endataziuns ed ils detagls ch'el stampa, en sia lingua. Quai che Europass n'ha nagin lieu per quai vegn inditgà sper la telechargiada. Sch'i è deactivà, na vegn la telechargiada betg purschida e sia adressa respunda sco sch'i n'ha nagut qua."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "A CV downloaded as a JSON Resume file, the open format many CV tools and themes read: its entries and the details it prints. What the format has no place for is said beside the download. Switched off, the download is not offered and its address answers as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "In CV telechargià sco datoteca JSON Resume, il format avert che blers instruments e models per CV legian: ses endataziuns ed ils detagls ch'el stampa. Quai che il format n'ha nagin lieu per quai vegn inditgà sper la telechargiada. Sch'i è deactivà, na vegn la telechargiada betg purschida e sia adressa respunda sco sch'i n'ha nagut qua."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Contacts, companies and your own details as .vcf cards, and a card file read in. Switched off, the downloads and the import are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Contacts, interpresas e Vossas atgnas indicaziuns sco cartas .vcf, e l'import d'ina datoteca da cartas. Sch'el è deactivà, na vegnan las telechargiadas e l'import betg purschids e lur adressas respundan sco sch'i na dess nagut là."

