msgstr "ODT"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Text OpenDocument: in CV u ina brev telechargià sco datoteca .odt, ed il text d'ina datoteca .odt che Vus chargiais si vegn memorisà, uschia ch'ina tschertga al po chattar. Sch'el è deactivà, na vegn la telechargiada betg purschida ed il text d'ina datoteca chargiada si na vegn betg legì."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Ils lieus da las interpresas sco datoteca GeoJSON, per export, e puncts importads che plazzeschan manualmain l'adressa d'ina interpresa, cur che Vus als avais marcads. Quai dovra Maps. Sch'el è deactivà, na vegn nagin dals dus purschì e lur adressas respundan sco sch'i na dess nagut là."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "Ils formats da datoteca che Postulo po leger e scriver ultra ses agen: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard ed Europass. Quai è il cumutatur per tut quels ensemen; mintgin po anc vegnir deactivà separadamain, durant che quest cumutatur è activà, mo PDF betg. Sch'el è deactivà, na vegn nagut purschì en quels formats e nagut na vegn stizzà: las datotecas che Vus avais e las datas, or da las qualas ellas èn vegnidas fatgas, restan."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "Il format en il qual in CV ed ina brev vegnan fatgs: structurà, uschia ch'in lectur da visur al po leger. Adina activà; Postulo n'ha nagut auter che fiss anc in CV."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Documents Word: in CV u ina brev telechargià sco datoteca .docx, ed il text d'ina datoteca .docx che Vus chargiais si vegn memorisà, uschia ch'ina tschertga al po chattar. Sch'el è deactivà, na vegn la telechargiada betg purschida ed il text d'ina datoteca chargiada si na vegn betg legì."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "Voss chalender sco datotecas .ics e feeds, e l'import d'ina datoteca da chalender. Sch'el è deactivà, na vegnan las telechargiadas, l'import ed ils feeds betg purschids e lur adressas respundan sco sch'i na dess nagut là; ellas respundan danovamain, a la medema adressa, sch'el vegn activà."
